    "id": "p_00042",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     5
    ],
    "text": "In the DESCRIPTION, the note about reentrancy is expanded to cover thread-safety.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00043",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     7
    ],
    "text": "The APPLICATION USAGE section is updated to include a note on the thread-safe function and its avoidance of possibly using a\nstatic data area.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00044",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     9
    ],
    "text": "The [B82]restrict[/B82] keyword is added to the [I83]strtok[/I83]() and [I84]strtok_r[/I84]() prototypes for alignment with the\nISO/IEC&nbsp;9899:1999 standard.",
    "placeholders": {
